  "description": "The DISKO 80's returns to the VELOCI lineup with updated details and a fresh 80’s-inspired paint scheme, bringing back the fun and versatility that made it a favorite from the beginning.\n\nBuilt around MKT heat-treated double- and triple-butted chromoly tubing, the frame keeps a balanced ride feel with responsive handling, good power transfer, and the smooth comfort steel bikes are known for.\n\nThe custom-bent allows for a shorter rear end, helping the bike feel quicker and more playful during acceleration while still remaining stable enough for gravel rides, daily riding, and longer adventures.\n\nFlat-mount disc brakes keep the bike clean-looking while providing reliable braking performance in all weather conditions. The updated segment taper fork now features dual triple-cage mounts alongside rack and fender mounts, making the DISKO 80's ready for commuting, gravel rides, or lightweight bikepacking setups.\n\nOne of the signature details is the curved wishbone seatstay, blending classic steel bike character with modern functionality in a simple and natural way.\n\nWhether built as a fast gravel bike, an all-road explorer, or an everyday adventure bike, the DISKO 80's is made for riders who enjoy mixing fun, practicality, and a bit of old-school personality into every ride.\n\nFrame weight: 2130g ( S size)",
